          ],
          "content": "D. 二磷酸甘油酸（BPG）通过与血红蛋白的结合降低其与氧的亲和力"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.064,
            0.033,
            0.615,
            0.054
          ],
          "content": "24. 下列哪种抑制剂可通过增加[S]的方法克服其抑制作用"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.079,
            0.056,
            0.277,
            0.144
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. 竞争性抑制剂\nB. 非竞争性抑制剂\nC. 反竞争性抑制剂\nD. 不可逆抑制剂"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.059,
            0.148,
            0.699,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": "25. 当酶促反应速度达到最大反应速度的 75%时，Km 与 [S] 的关系是"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.075,
            0.172,
            0.21,
            0.258
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. [S] =Km\nB. [S] =2Km\nC. [S] =3Km\nD. [S] =4Km"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.055,
            0.263,
            0.517,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": "26. 维生素 $\\mathrm{B}_{12}$ (氰钴胺素) 是下列哪种酶的辅酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.071,
            0.287,
            0.184,
            0.373
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. 脱氢酶\nB. 脱羧酶\nC. 转氨酶\nD. 变位酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.051,
            0.378,
            0.527,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": "27. 催化糖原合酶激酶-3（GSK3）磷酸化的激酶是"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.069,
            0.401,
            0.15,
            0.487
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. PKA\nB. PKB\nC. PKC\nD. PKG"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.047,
            0.492,
            0.469,
            0.513
          ],
          "content": "28. 蛋白激酶 C 的活性依赖于下列那组物质"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.064,
            0.515,
            0.203,
            0.602
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. ${\\mathrm{{Ca}}}^{2 + }$ 和 $\\mathrm{{PE}}$\nB. PS 和 PC\nC. ${\\mathrm{{Ca}}}^{2 + }$ 和 PS\nD. ${\\mathrm{{Ca}}}^{2 + }$ 和 DAG"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.044,
            0.607,
            0.339,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": "29. 心房肽（ANF）受体是一种"
